abstract: >-
  Mixed-model haplotype association at the window and gene scales for family-structured
  populations: a calibrated null model with a genomic relationship matrix
  and a dam effect, regional relatedness-kernel and haplotype-class tests combined by
  ACAT, functional haplotypes with matched neutral control haplotypes, and resampling,
  conditional and power analyses.
keywords:
  - haplotype association
  - mixed model
  - kernel association test
  - livestock genomics
